# The canonical generated verifier is intentionally tracked at
# src/ZKMLVerifier.sol so a circuit/VK/verifier bundle has a reviewable identity.
# Regeneration must therefore produce an explicit Git diff and be accompanied by
# the ZKML artifact manifest/validation evidence. Do not add alternate live
# verifier copies elsewhere in this module.

